---
import PortfolioLayout from '../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro';
---
<PortfolioLayout
  title="Ubaldo Figueroa — Full-Stack Developer & Growth Engineer"
  description="Full-stack developer who ships end to end — design, code, deploy. Four live production sites, including an AI news platform that publishes itself. Available for freelance and full-time work."
>

<a href="#pf-main" class="pf-skip">Skip to content</a>

<!-- ── NAV ── -->
<nav class="pf-nav" aria-label="Primary">
  <a href="/" class="pf-logo">UF</a>
  <div class="pf-links">
    <a href="#work">Work</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<section class="pf-hero" id="pf-main">
  <div class="pf-hero-bg">
    <img src="/baldo-headshot.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="1080" height="1055"
         decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="pf-hero-overlay"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pf-hero-text">
    <div class="pf-available"><span class="pf-dot"></span>Available for work</div>
    <h1 class="pf-h1">
      Hey, I'm<br/>
      <span class="pf-name">Ubaldo Figueroa</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="pf-redline"></div>
    <p class="pf-role">Full-Stack Developer & Growth Engineer</p>
    <p class="pf-desc">From the barber&rsquo;s chair to four live production sites — including an AI news platform that publishes itself. I own every one end to end — design, build, deploy, and keep them running.</p>
    <p class="pf-typed"><span class="pf-hash">#</span> I build <span id="pf-tw"></span></p>
    <div class="pf-btns">
      <a href="#contact" class="pf-btn">Hire Me →</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/ubaldo28" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-btn-ghost pf-gh">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 0a8 8 0 0 0-2.53 15.59c.4.07.55-.17.55-.38l-.01-1.34c-2.23.48-2.7-1.07-2.7-1.07-.36-.93-.89-1.18-.89-1.18-.73-.5.06-.49.06-.49.8.06 1.23.83 1.23.83.72 1.23 1.87.87 2.33.67.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82a7.6 7.6 0 0 1 4 0c1.53-1.03 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.28.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48l-.01 2.2c0 .21.14.46.55.38A8 8 0 0 0 8 0z"/></svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-tech-strip">
      <span>Astro</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>JavaScript</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>React</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>Node.js</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>HTML</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>CSS</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>Cloudflare</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>Git</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>Figma</span><span class="pf-strip-dot">·</span>
      <span>SEO</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pf-hero-stats">
    <div class="pf-stat"><div class="pf-stat-num">4</div><div class="pf-stat-label">live sites</div></div>
    <div class="pf-stat-sep"></div>
    <div class="pf-stat"><div class="pf-stat-num">2</div><div class="pf-stat-label">paying clients</div></div>
    <div class="pf-stat-sep"></div>
    <div class="pf-stat"><div class="pf-stat-num">0</div><div class="pf-stat-label">handoffs</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── CAPABILITIES ── -->
<div class="pf-about">
  <div class="pf-caps">
    <div class="pf-cap">
      <span class="pf-cap-num">01 / What I build</span>
      <h2 class="pf-cap-title">Full-Stack<br/>Web Dev</h2>
      <p class="pf-cap-desc">Design, code, launch. I take a brief the whole way to a live URL and own it after that too.</p>
      <div class="pf-cap-tags"><span>Astro</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>HTML/CSS</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-cap">
      <span class="pf-cap-num">02 / How I grow it</span>
      <h2 class="pf-cap-title">SEO &<br/>Organic Growth</h2>
      <p class="pf-cap-desc">Sites built to rank from day one. Technical SEO, content, and structure baked in — not bolted on after.</p>
      <div class="pf-cap-tags"><span>On-page SEO</span><span>Technical</span><span>Copy</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-cap">
      <span class="pf-cap-num">03 / What you get</span>
      <h2 class="pf-cap-title">Brief to<br/>Browser.</h2>
      <p class="pf-cap-desc">First message to live URL — strategy, design, dev, deploy, and the decisions in between.</p>
      <div class="pf-cap-tags"><span>End-to-end</span><span>Production-ready</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pf-cred-col">
    <div class="pf-cred-box">
      <p class="pf-cred-head">The case for hiring me</p>
      <div class="pf-cred-row">
        <span class="pf-dot-g"></span>
        <span><strong>4 production sites</strong> you can visit right now</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-cred-row">
        <span class="pf-dot-g"></span>
        <span><strong>2 paying clients</strong>, one of whom trusted me first</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-cred-row">
        <span class="pf-dot-g"></span>
        <span>Went from <strong>zero to four live sites</strong> since January</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-cred-row pf-cred-muted">
        <span class="pf-dot-dim"></span>
        <span>No bootcamp. No agency. No shortcuts.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-stack-box">
      <p class="pf-stack-head">Tech stack</p>
      <div class="pf-stack-group">
        <p class="pf-stack-cat">Frontend</p>
        <div class="pf-pills"><span class="hi">Astro</span><span class="hi">JavaScript</span><span>HTML / CSS</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-stack-group">
        <p class="pf-stack-cat">Deploy & tooling</p>
        <div class="pf-pills"><span>Cloudflare Pages</span><span>Git / GitHub</span><span>Figma</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-stack-group">
        <p class="pf-stack-cat">Growth</p>
        <div class="pf-pills"><span class="hi">SEO</span><span>Analytics</span><span>Copywriting</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── AVAILABLE BANNER ── -->
<div class="pf-avail-banner">
  <div class="pf-avail-inner">
    <span class="pf-avail-dot"></span>
    <span class="pf-avail-text">Currently available for freelance projects & full-time roles</span>
    <a href="#contact" class="pf-avail-cta">Let's Talk →</a>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── WORK ── -->
<section class="pf-work" id="work">
  <p class="pf-label">Selected Work</p>
  <h2 class="pf-work-title">Projects<span class="pf-work-dot">.</span></h2>

  <!-- 01 -->
  <div class="pf-project">
    <div class="pf-project-meta">
      <span class="pf-num">01</span>
      <span class="pf-tag">Own product · Live since January 2026</span>
      <a href="https://potuswatchdaily.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-link">potuswatchdaily.com ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-project-body">
      <div class="pf-project-info">
        <h3 class="pf-title">POTUS Watch Daily</h3>
        <p class="pf-pdesc">A foreign-policy publication that researches, writes and publishes itself. Built on the Claude API, it produces multiple dispatches a day across desks covering the Americas, China, NATO, Iran, the Middle East, Russia, trade and analysis — with a breaking-news ticker, archive, newsletter, and a published editorial standards policy.</p>
        <p class="pf-outcome"><strong>What changed:</strong> this is a production AI system, not a demo. It has run on an automated publishing pipeline since January 2026, generating and shipping content daily without manual intervention.</p>
        <div class="pf-metrics">
          <div>Publishes unattended, multiple times a day</div>
          <div>Live breaking-news ticker and archive</div>
          <div>Published editorial standards policy</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tags">
          <span>Autonomous Pipeline</span><span>Breaking News</span><span>Archive</span><span>Newsletter</span><span>Monetised</span>
        </div>
        <p class="pf-stack"><strong>Stack</strong> Astro (SSR) · Cloudflare Pages · Supabase / PostgreSQL · Node.js · Claude API (Haiku) · NewsAPI · Unsplash API · Railway · GitHub Actions · Wrangler · IndexNow</p>
        <a href="https://potuswatchdaily.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-view-btn">View Live Site →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-browser">
        <div class="pf-browser-bar">
          <span class="bd r"></span><span class="bd y"></span><span class="bd g"></span>
          <span class="burl">potuswatchdaily.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-browser-content">
          <a href="https://potuswatchdaily.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-shot-link">
            <img src="/portfolio-potus.webp" alt="POTUS Watch Daily: an AI-run foreign-policy publication with a breaking-news ticker"
                 width="1176" height="1026" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 02 -->
  <div class="pf-project pf-flip">
    <div class="pf-project-meta">
      <span class="pf-num">02</span>
      <span class="pf-tag">Freelance · 2026</span>
      <a href="https://geniotech.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-link">geniotech.co.uk ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-project-body">
      <div class="pf-browser">
        <div class="pf-browser-bar">
          <span class="bd r"></span><span class="bd y"></span><span class="bd g"></span>
          <span class="burl">geniotech.co.uk</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-browser-content pf-gt" aria-hidden="true">
          <video id="pf-gt-video" data-src="/geniotech-hero.mp4" poster="/geniotech-hero-poster.webp"
