            <div class="pf-gt-right"><i class="pf-gt-soc"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17" cy="7" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></i><i class="pf-gt-soc"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M14.5 8.5h2V5.6h-2.3c-2 0-3.2 1.3-3.2 3.3v1.6H9v2.9h2v8.1h3v-8.1h2.2l.4-2.9H14v-1.2c0-.6.2-.8.5-.8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></i><i class="pf-gt-soc"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M15 3.5v9.9a3.1 3.1 0 1 1-2.4-3v2.6a.9.9 0 1 0 .9.9V3.5H15c.3 1.7 1.4 2.9 3.2 3.1v2.5c-1.2-.1-2.3-.5-3.2-1.2z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></i><span class="pf-gt-install">Install App</span><span class="pf-gt-book">Quick book &#8594;</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="pf-gt-hero">
            <span class="pf-gt-badge"><i></i>Opens today at 9 am</span>
            <p class="pf-gt-h">Dundee&#39;s go-to<br/>repair shop.<br/><em>Fast. Trusted.</em></p>
            <p class="pf-gt-p">Cracked screens fixed in under an hour. iPhones,<br/>Samsungs, tablets, laptops. Award-winning service on<br/>Hilltown.</p>
            <span class="pf-gt-cta">Book a repair</span>
          </div>

          <div class="pf-gt-ticker">
            <span>iPhone screen &middot; from &pound;29</span><span>Samsung glass &middot; from &pound;29</span><span>Battery replacement &middot; from &pound;29</span><span>Water damage repair</span><span>MacBook screen fix</span><span>Same-day repairs</span><span>Call: 01382 221017</span><span>29 Hilltown, Dundee</span>
          </div>

          <div class="pf-gt-stats">
            <div><b>4.7&#9733;</b><span>Google rating</span></div>
            <div><b>200+</b><span>verified reviews</span></div>
            <div><b>&lt;1hr</b><span>most screen repairs</span></div>
            <div><b>&#127942;</b><span>Scottish Retail winner</span></div>
            <div><b>&#129351;</b><span>UK SBA 2026 Finalist</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="pf-gt-svc">
            <span class="pf-gt-svc-lbl">services</span>
            <p class="pf-gt-svc-h">What we fix</p>
            <p class="pf-gt-svc-sub">Quality parts &middot; professional repairs &middot; guaranteed work</p>
            <div class="pf-gt-cards">
              <div><i></i><b>iPhone</b><p>Screen, battery, charging port, cameras and more</p><em>from &pound;29</em></div>
              <div><i></i><b>Samsung &amp; Android</b><p>Galaxy, Huawei, Pixel and all models</p><em>from &pound;29</em></div>
              <div><i></i><b>Tablets</b><p>iPad, Samsung Tab, Huawei and more</p><em>from &pound;39</em></div>
              <div><i></i><b>Laptops &amp; Macs</b><p>Screen, keyboard, battery, software</p><em>from &pound;49</em></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-project-info">
        <h3 class="pf-title">GenioTech</h3>
        <p class="pf-pdesc">Full site build for a working repair shop in Dundee. Customers choose their device, see a starting price, and book a repair slot online instead of phoning the shop. Includes an accessories store, photo and video gallery, blog, newsletter capture, and an installable PWA.</p>
        <p class="pf-outcome"><strong>What changed:</strong> bookings moved off the phone and onto the site. Customers self-serve by device type and see pricing before they commit, with newsletter signup built into the flow behind a 10% first-order incentive.</p>
        <div class="pf-metrics">
          <div>Built for an award-winning independent retailer</div>
          <div>The shop holds a Scottish Independent Retail Award and 4.7★ across 200+ verified reviews</div>
          <div>Named a finalist at the UK Small Business Awards 2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tags">
          <span>Booking System</span><span>E-commerce</span><span>PWA</span><span>SEO</span><span>Newsletter</span>
        </div>
        <p class="pf-stack"><strong>Stack</strong> Astro 4 · TypeScript · Cloudflare Pages · Cloudflare Workers · Stripe · Resend · Cal.eu · Service Worker PWA · JSON-LD</p>
        <a href="https://geniotech.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-view-btn">View Live Site →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 03 -->
  <div class="pf-project">
    <div class="pf-project-meta">
      <span class="pf-num">03</span>
      <span class="pf-tag">Own build · 2026</span>
      <a href="https://whereisbaldo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-link">whereisbaldo.com ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pf-project-body">
      <div class="pf-browser">
        <div class="pf-browser-bar">
          <span class="bd r"></span><span class="bd y"></span><span class="bd g"></span>
          <span class="burl">whereisbaldo.com</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-browser-content">
          <a href="https://whereisbaldo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-shot-link">
            <img src="/portfolio-baldo-v2.webp" alt="Where Is Baldo?: a custom publishing platform with dark mode and search"
                 width="1600" height="1088" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pf-project-info">
        <h3 class="pf-title">Where Is Baldo?</h3>
        <p class="pf-pdesc">A custom publishing platform, built from scratch rather than assembled on an off-the-shelf CMS. Transactional email through Resend, web push through Webpushr, dark mode, search, generated social cards, and an installable PWA.</p>
        <p class="pf-outcome"><strong>What it&rsquo;s for:</strong> this is where I test infrastructure before it goes near client work. The email and push stack running here is the same one I would deploy for a client.</p>
        <div class="pf-metrics">
          <div>Installable PWA with web push</div>
          <div>Transactional email on Resend</div>
          <div>Per-post social cards generated at build time</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tags">
          <span>Custom Design</span><span>Dark Mode</span><span>Search</span><span>PWA</span><span>Web Push</span><span>Generated Social Cards</span>
        </div>
        <p class="pf-stack"><strong>Stack</strong> Astro 7 · Cloudflare Pages · Cloudflare Functions · Resend · Webpushr · Decap CMS</p>
        <a href="https://whereisbaldo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-view-btn">View Live Site →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 04 -->
  <div class="pf-project pf-flip">
    <div class="pf-project-meta">
      <span class="pf-num">04</span>
      <span class="pf-tag">Freelance &middot; 2026</span>
      <a href="https://peak-vending.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-link">peak-vending.com &#8599;</a>
    </div>
