      <div class="pf-project-info">
        <h3 class="pf-title">Peak Vending</h3>
        <p class="pf-pdesc">A site for a Dundee vending operator covering Tayside and Fife. Services and coverage areas are content collections rather than hard-coded pages, so a new location or service is a markdown file, not a rebuild of the template.</p>
        <p class="pf-outcome"><strong>How it&rsquo;s built:</strong> every page is prerendered to static HTML and served from Cloudflare&rsquo;s edge, and the site ships almost no JavaScript. One route runs server-side &mdash; the contact form, which delivers through Resend. No framework, no Tailwind: plain CSS with custom properties and vanilla JS.</p>
        <div class="pf-metrics">
          <div>Static HTML at the edge, near-zero JavaScript shipped</div>
          <div>Services and locations authored as content collections</div>
          <div>Contact form live on Resend</div>
          <div>Print flyers generated from the same codebase &mdash; HTML laid out at millimetre dimensions, rendered to PDF with Playwright, QR codes generated at build</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tags">
          <span>Static Site</span><span>Content Collections</span><span>Cloudflare Workers</span><span>Transactional Email</span><span>Print / PDF</span><span>Vanilla JS</span>
        </div>
        <p class="pf-stack"><strong>Stack</strong> Astro 7 &middot; Cloudflare Workers &middot; Wrangler &middot; Astro content collections &middot; plain CSS &middot; vanilla JS &middot; Resend &middot; @fontsource (Barlow Semi Condensed, Source Sans 3) &middot; Playwright &middot; potrace</p>
        <a href="https://peak-vending.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pf-view-btn">View Live Site &#8594;</a>
